{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"b89443064fdbf84d","type":"text","text":"## Open Telemetry\n\nOpen telemetry is a **vendor agnostic observability framework**\n\n* Helps with the **generation**, **processing** and **transmission** of different types of **telemetry data**.\n\t* **Metrics**\n\t* **Traces**\n\t* **Logs**\n* **Open framework** managed by the cloud native computing foundation, supported by multiple vendors.\n* Having a standard across lots of platforms makes it easier to develop a comprehensive view of a distributed system.![[Pasted image 20261005143919.png]]","x":-240,"y":-180,"width":580,"height":360},
		{"id":"56a46f814818944b","type":"text","text":"## Instrumentation\n\nAllows generation of signals to observe the system, can be done with **language specific libraries** implemented by Open Telemetry\n\n(.NET example shown using middleware to register Open Telemetry support)","x":-620,"y":-540,"width":440,"height":240},
		{"id":"4d2c0488c8b4e6af","type":"text","text":"## OTLP\n\nData generated by service with open telemetry protocol which describes properties of the system being observed. Means **data** from **different types of services** can be **correlated** together and **compared**.","x":-120,"y":-540,"width":350,"height":240},
		{"id":"34fe10ce17d2c928","type":"text","text":"## Collector \n\nA process that takes information from the client services and **processes/aggregates** it. Can then be **sent on** to other **collectors** or a **backend**.\n\n* Optionally can communicate information straight from the service to the backend but takes extra compute.","x":280,"y":-540,"width":400,"height":240},
		{"id":"b97afc912b0ee17e","type":"file","file":"Attachments/Pasted image 20261005142838.png","x":-600,"y":-1000,"width":400,"height":332},
		{"id":"bab7031017cd2bc4","type":"text","text":"## Observability Backend\n\nOT is not a product, its a framework.\n\n* 3rd party products will take data from the collector and process, filter and visualise it.\n\t* Grafana\n\t* Application Insights\n\t* Prometheus\n\t* Data Dog","x":760,"y":-540,"width":440,"height":240},
		{"id":"58b734d0ad40b36d","type":"file","file":"Attachments/Pasted image 20261005143920.png","x":280,"y":-834,"width":400,"height":139}
	],
